  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "62",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 62"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "62",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For Zion's sake will I not hold my peace, and for Jerusalem's sake I will not rest, until the righteousness thereof go forth as brightness, and the salvation thereof as a lamp",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.62.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.62.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "burneth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the Gentiles shall see thy righteousness, and all kings thy glory: and thou shalt be called by a new name, which the mouth of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.62.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.62.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shall name.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou shalt also be a crown of glory in the hand of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.62.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.62.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and a royal diadem in the hand of thy God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou shalt no more be termed Forsaken; neither shall thy land any more be termed Desolate: but thou shalt be called Hephzi-bah, and thy land Beulah: for the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.62.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.62.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "delighteth in thee, and thy land shall be married.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ For",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "as",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.62.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.62.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a young man marrieth a virgin,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "so",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.62.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.62.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shall thy sons marry thee: and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "as",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.62.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.62.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the bridegroom rejoiceth over the bride,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "so",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.62.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.62.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shall thy God rejoice over thee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I have set watchmen upon thy walls, O Jerusalem,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "which",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.62.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.62.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shall never hold their peace day nor night: ye that make mention of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.62.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.62.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", keep not silence,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And give him no rest, till he establish, and till he make Jerusalem a praise in the earth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.62.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.62.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hath sworn by his right hand, and by the arm of his strength, Surely I will no more give thy corn",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "to be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.62.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.62.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "meat for thine enemies; and the sons of the stranger shall not drink thy wine, for the which thou hast laboured:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But they that have gathered it shall eat it, and praise the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.62.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.62.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; and they that have brought it together shall drink it in the courts of my holiness.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Go through, go through the gates; prepare ye the way of the people; cast up, cast up the highway; gather out the stones; lift up a standard for the people.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.62.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.62.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hath proclaimed unto the end of the world, Say ye to the daughter of Zion, Behold, thy salvation cometh; behold, his reward",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.62.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.62.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "with him, and his work before him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they shall call them, The holy people, The redeemed of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.62.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.62.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ": and thou shalt be called, Sought out, A city not forsaken.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
